<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad Rotterdam nine-months profit rises.</title>
<headline>Stad Rotterdam nine-months profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.29 vs   2.94</p>
<p>    Net profit			   103.2  vs  89.3</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  3.0  vs   2.6</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast net profits of Stad Rotterdam Anno 1720 NV of 101.3 million guilders for the first nine month, a rise of 13 percent compared to the same period of 1995.  </p>
<p>    interim dividend (guilders)    0.94  vs  0.84</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit per sector:</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit non life	 75.7   vs 58.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit life	     85.0   vs 79.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit other activ.   19.6   vs 16.8</p>
<p>    Tax				   51.9   vs 42.9</p>
<p>    Third party interests	   25.2   vs 21.8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
